messages.content:
Extract structured data from the following meeting notes. Return ONLY a JSON object with this exact schema. No prose, no code fences.

{
  "meeting_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
  "project": string,
  "attendees": [{"name": string, "role": string}],
  "decisions": [string],
  "action_items": [
    {
      "owner": string,
      "task": string,
      "due_date": "YYYY-MM-DD or null if not specified"
    }
  ]
}

Begin with { and end with }.

